{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q114748629","formula":"C₂₆H₃₄ClN₃O₄","hill":"C26H34ClN3O4","elements":["H","C","N","O","Cl"],"composition":{"C":26.0,"H":34.0,"N":3.0,"O":4.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Valemetostat","uk":"Валеметостат"},"descriptions":{"en":"Valemetostat (trade name Ezharmia) is a drug used for the treatment of adult T-cell leukemia/lymphoma (ATL). Valemetostat is an inhibitor of the enzymes enhancer of zeste homolog 1 (EZH1) and enhancer of zeste homolog 2 (EZH2), which are implicated in the etiology of some forms of cancer including non-Hodgkin lymphomas. In Japan, valemetostat was approved in September 2022 for patients with relapsed or refractory adult T-cell leukemia/lymphoma.","uk":"Валеметостат (англ. Valemetostat), що випускається під торговою маркою «Ежармія» — лікарський препарат, що використовується для лікування Т-клітинних лейкозів/лімфом у дорослих. Валеметостат є інгібітором ферментів, що підсилюють дію гомолога 1 цистеїну (EZH1) та гомолога 2 цистеїну (EZH2), які беруть участь у формуванні деяких форм раку, включаючи неходжкінські лімфоми."},"fame":2,"pubchemCid":126481870,"mass":488.0,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1=CC(=C(C(=O)N1)CNC(=O)C2=CC(=C3C(=C2C)O[C@@](O3)(C)C4CCC(CC4)N(C)C)Cl)C","inchikey":"SSDRNUPMYCFXGM-ZZHSESOFSA-N","iupac":"(2R)-7-chloro-2-[4-(dimethylamino)cyclohexyl]-N-[(4,6-dimethyl-2-oxo-1H-pyridin-3-yl)methyl]-2,4-dimethyl-1,3-benzodioxole-5-carboxamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"126481870","atoms":68,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":7.55,"y":2.314,"z":0.865,"el":"C"},{"x":6.851,"y":1.285,"z":0.033,"el":"C"},{"x":6.505,"y":1.471,"z":-1.249,"el":"C"},{"x":5.828,"y":0.428,"z":-2.008,"el":"C"},{"x":5.529,"y":-0.752,"z":-1.421,"el":"C"},{"x":5.903,"y":-0.95,"z":0.019,"el":"C"},{"x":5.629,